// @hint redundant type annotation: `a7` is inferred as `{xs: i32[]}[]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `a8` is inferred as `{p: i32}[]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `a10` is inferred as `{count: i32, symbol: i32}[][][]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `b10` is inferred as `{count: i32, symbol: i32}[][][]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `b8` is inferred as `{p: i32}[]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `b7` is inferred as `{xs: i32[]}[]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `b6` is inferred as `i32[][][]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `b5` is inferred as `boolean[][]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `b4` is inferred as `{count: i32, symbol: i32}[][]`
