// @hint redundant type annotation: `b2` is inferred as `i32[][]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `b1` is inferred as `{count: i32, symbol: i32}[]`
// @hint redundant type annotation: `c1` is inferred as `{[string]: i32}[]`
